"recompilation under glibc-2.1.91 or later should suffice.  (The kernel "
"distinguishes old and new calls by an B<IPC_64> flag in I<cmd>.)"
msgstr ""
"В Linux 2.2 различные поля I<struct semid_ds> имели тип I<short>. В Linux "
